WHO CONTENT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project links to and fetches health information from the World Health
Organization (WHO) at runtime. No WHO article text is stored in this
repository.

WHO content is © World Health Organization. It is not relicensed under this
project's MIT or CC BY 4.0 licences. Use of WHO content is subject to WHO's
terms, including its reuse and copyright policy:

  https://www.who.int/about/policies/publishing/copyright

WHO does not endorse this project or any product, service or organisation.
Answers generated by this app are not official WHO statements.

The runtime fetcher in `app/services/who_knowledge.py` uses canonical WHO URLs
and keeps short topic titles and links only. Fetched text is cached locally in
`storage/who_cache/`, which is excluded from version control.

